        "title": "Widow’s Bay creator explains finale twists, teases season 2 plans",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/17/widows-bay-creator-explains-finale-twists-teases-season-2-plans/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/12/widows-bay-matthew-rhys.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple TV aired the <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/15/apple-teases-widows-bay-season-finale-airing-this-week/\" type=\"post\" id=\"1056775\">Widow’s Bay finale</a> last night, and today in a new interview the show’s creator goes behind the scenes on the finale, the upcoming season 2, and more.</p>",
